{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your cozy farm, master the market, and help feed your growing village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/a9feaf088538afc0617505ec45e570fa.poster.avif?t=1772055335\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/a9feaf088538afc0617505ec45e570fa.webm?t=1772055335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/a9feaf088538afc0617505ec45e570fa.mp4?t=1772055335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crop prices change daily. Village demand never stays still. Can you grow smart enough to keep everyone fed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/15c5272efe88096905106bd224e2840d.poster.avif?t=1772055335\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/15c5272efe88096905106bd224e2840d.webm?t=1772055335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930640/extras/15c5272efe88096905106bd224e2840d.mp4?t=1772055335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch the Market</strong><br>Crop prices shift every day based on supply and demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Your Sales</strong><br>Town events create demand spikes - sell at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Village Quests</strong><br>Help villagers restore the town\u2019s struggling market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed the Village<